{
  "an3.117:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.117 ",
  "an3.117:0.2": "12. Āpāyikavagga ",
  "an3.117:0.3": "Vipattisampadāsutta ",
  "an3.117:1.1": "“Tisso imā, bhikkhave, vipattiyo. ",
  "an3.117:1.2": "Katamā tisso? ",
  "an3.117:1.3": "Sīlavipatti, cittavipatti, diṭṭhivipatti. ",
  "an3.117:1.4": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, sīlavipatti? ",
  "an3.117:1.5": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco pāṇātipātī hoti, adinnādāyī hoti, kāmesumicchācārī hoti, musāvādī hoti, pisuṇavāco hoti, pharusavāco hoti, samphappalāpī hoti. ",
  "an3.117:1.6": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, sīlavipatti. ",
  "an3.117:2.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, cittavipatti? ",
  "an3.117:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco abhijjhālu hoti byāpannacitto. ",
  "an3.117:2.3": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, cittavipatti. ",
  "an3.117:3.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, diṭṭhivipatti? ",
  "an3.117:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco micchādiṭṭhiko hoti viparītadassano: ",
  "an3.117:3.3": "‘natthi dinnaṁ, natthi yiṭṭhaṁ, natthi hutaṁ, natthi sukatadukkaṭānaṁ, kammānaṁ phalaṁ vipāko, natthi ayaṁ loko, natthi paro loko, natthi mātā, natthi pitā, natthi sattā opapātikā, natthi loke samaṇabrāhmaṇā sammaggatā sammāpaṭipannā ye imañca lokaṁ parañca lokaṁ sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā pavedentī’ti. ",
  "an3.117:3.4": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, diṭṭhivipatti. ",
  "an3.117:3.5": "Sīlavipattihetu vā, bhikkhave, sattā kāyassa bhedā paraṁ maraṇā apāyaṁ duggatiṁ vinipātaṁ niray